        "title": "Kandih ringmei duiriang hei",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih ringmei duirianghei luai tat sini,",
            "Hu thu namdai gaimei kanan ram 6$%;",
            "Akhang neilamei pirun 6$% naguang the,",
            "Kapma kandih ram khou hei bam sang lakkhe.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Tingsang lakkhe kandih rianramei guai,",
            "Kanlou pui khuan 6$% ai chu lana;",
            "Guang bampang khou nkhuanNgammak pui khuan rui;",
            "Jianmei nun kaumei tingsang lakkhe tu e.",
            "",
            "2. Ai bampui ram duiriang hei sang khuan sini,",
            "Jailoumei pu ganphiu 6$% jau lana;",
            "Tingkau nthanmei ram tang lou puni e,",
            "Khou 6$% njianmei nun bam cham puni e.",
            "",
            "3. Njuan nithe ai tingsang gai pui ram 6$%,",
            "Munpuang gaimei guai 6$% puang tuai lakkhe;",
            "Lauhiu Nah le tingkau munpuang pui ram 6$%,",
            "He nang jei pan khou rui ai guang tang ni.",
            "",
            "4. Sa bammei ram gaimei khou guang tang pukhou,",
            "Thei thu man kan nimei ta ning lakkhe;",
            "Poubaumei ram tigan loumei guai 6$% ni,",
            "Tak makna tingsangjang gan bam puni the."
          ]
        }
      }
